{"unit_id":"Kiol-V__dsh-agent-tool-filter#card-zh","repo":"Kiol-V/dsh-agent-tool-filter","commit":"0179bd7736d06df50a31ace160cf451a6a5bbdf6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-tool-filter 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的主智能体工具筛选插件。它在智能体创建、预设变更和配置重载时读取根智能体的预设，并按配置的「预设→配置档」映射在该智能体作用域调用工具限制接口。用户可配置允许或拒绝名单、选择隐藏工具方案，并在插件设置面板管理映射与配置档；代码还提供子智能体扩权请求及输入区审批面板。该插件适合希望为不同主智能体预设配置不同工具集合的 DSH 用户。安装后默认映射为空，需在插件界面配置预设映射才会应用筛选；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:46-53","cordis.patch.yml:1-4","plugin.mjs:168-210","lib/agent-filter.mjs:42-105","lib/restriction.mjs:26-89","client/index.jsx:1061-1079"]}
{"unit_id":"Kiol-V__dsh-agent-tool-filter#card-en","repo":"Kiol-V/dsh-agent-tool-filter","commit":"0179bd7736d06df50a31ace160cf451a6a5bbdf6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-agent-tool-filter is a DSH Web plugin that maps root-agent presets to allow or deny profiles and applies tool restrictions in that agent's scope. Users manage profiles in the settings panel; optional subagent escalation requests can appear in an approval panel. The preset map starts empty.","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:46-53","cordis.patch.yml:1-4","plugin.mjs:168-210","lib/agent-filter.mjs:42-105","lib/restriction.mjs:26-89","client/index.jsx:1061-1079"]}
